<title>USA: Royal Caribbean to add port charges to ads.</title>
<headline>Royal Caribbean to add port charges to ads.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Caribbean Cruises Ltd said on Wednesday it will begin including port charges in advertised prices as part of a voluntary agreement with the Florida attorney general.</p>
<p>The company said the change will not affect the total price paid by the consumer.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
